        // 45ns   1   0   6b  1    2c8109
        // Ah! At 45ns, clk is 1, in is 6b, done is 1, out_bytes is 2c8109.
        // That means at the rising edge of 45ns, done is 1!
        // Why was done=0 at t=45 in my previous check? Because my check happened at t=44 (before clk edge).
